pkgbase = dod-pki-setup
	pkgdesc = One-click setup for DoD/DoW CAC/PKI on Arch Linux: Install middleware and drivers, DoD cert bundle v5.14, enable pcscd service, register OpenSC PKCS#11 in browser. Works out of the box on Mozilla/Firefox and Chromium/Chrome
